      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "Qt-free C++23 LVUI AOT example for MaterialSurface, PanelMaterial and WindowMaterial.\nShows captured and standalone blur, eight accent gradients, a custom silhouette, cached masks,\nshared Core frame motion, retained editor state and background-result delivery.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "Build using the installed Native LVRS package. `install.sh` stages into `build/install` by default\nand never runs tests or opens the app. Runtime validation remains deferred to the final whole-goal\nbatch. See [usage](docs/Usage.md) and the SDK material documentation for remaining contracts.\n"
    }
  ],
